<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  </head>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background:#f4f4f7; margin:0; padding:24px;">
    <table align="center" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
      style="background:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden;">
      <tr>
        <td style="background:#0ea5e9; padding:20px 28px; color:#ffffff;">
          <h2 style="margin:0; font-size:18px;">CleanZ</h2>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:28px;">
          <p style="margin:0 0 8px; color:#111827;">Xin chào {{fullName}},</p>
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 12px; color:#111827;">{{title}}</h3>
          {{#if content}}
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.6;">{{content}}</p>
          {{/if}}
          <p style="margin:24px 0 0; color:#9ca3af; font-size:12px;">
            Đây là email thông báo tự động từ CleanZ. Vui lòng không trả lời email này.
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
